{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだお仕事のときななみと\n楽屋でおとなりだったのヽ(〃v〃)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたら休憩中にななみが、\n私のクシ(髪の毛とかすやつ)の\n先っちょの棒みたいになってるとこ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりゃあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/asuka.saito/img/files/46/_pre/blog/asuka.saito/img/2014/03/08/8267471/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これを私の鼻にちょんちょんしてきて\n爆笑しだしたの。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"急に何だろう？って思って\n聞いてみたら...(OωO )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「あすかww\n鼻の弾力すごいよww」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だって(OωO )(OωO )笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そっから何回も\n鏡で見ながら鼻にツンツンして、\n弾力を確かめながら\n2人で爆笑してました((o(｡>ω<｡)o))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーななみん可愛い(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というわけでななみ生誕祭の写真\nずーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりゃあ(連発)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/asuka.saito/img/files/46/_pre/blog/asuka.saito/img/2014/03/08/8267471/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんのもとへ向かうななみ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/asuka.saito/img/files/46/_pre/blog/asuka.saito/img/2014/03/08/8267471/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/asuka.saito/img/files/46/_pre/blog/asuka.saito/img/2014/03/08/8267471/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌ってもらってるななみ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/asuka.saito/img/files/46/_pre/blog/asuka.saito/img/2014/03/08/8267471/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/asuka.saito/img/files/46/_pre/blog/asuka.saito/img/2014/03/08/8267471/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいに手紙を読んでもらってるが\n喜びを表すのが下手な橋本さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/asuka.saito/img/files/46/_pre/blog/asuka.saito/img/2014/03/08/8267471/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/asuka.saito/img/files/46/_pre/blog/asuka.saito/img/2014/03/08/8267471/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りんご姫さん登場"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/asuka.saito/img/files/46/_pre/blog/asuka.saito/img/2014/03/08/8267471/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"橋本奈々未生誕祭でなぜこの2人が\n抱き合っているのでしょうか...\n(可愛いからなんでもいい)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白石麻衣♡松村沙友理\nベストカポー。フゥーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/asuka.saito/img/files/46/_pre/blog/asuka.saito/img/2014/03/08/8267471/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/asuka.saito/img/files/46/_pre/blog/asuka.saito/img/2014/03/08/8267471/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーかわいい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみファンの方みんなが\n\"ブログに写真 載せてよカメラ小僧～\"\nって言ってたからたくさん載せた♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お義父さんもおめでとうございました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え、ごめんて...\nななみパパをお義父さんとか呼んじゃってごめんて...怒らんでーよ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あでも、あしゅの旦那さんは\nあなたかなヽ(〃v〃)ﾉ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん？(＾ω＾)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりゃあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/asuka.saito/img/files/46/_pre/blog/asuka.saito/img/2014/03/08/8267471/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この写真お気に入りだから\nななみの衣装が公開OKになったら\nまた載っけるー♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーーーーーーーーーー\nこんな感じの記事あげたら、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私、ななみに\n気持ち悪いと思われちゃうーーーー笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりゃあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/asuka.saito/img/files/46/_pre/blog/asuka.saito/img/2014/03/08/8267471/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"DANN☆RYOKU"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うーーーードワンゴッッ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://music.dwango.jp/i/special/navidial_nogizaka46?cp_webto=oshieru_sp_special"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んちゃっっ"}],"source":"archive"}